@startuml
actor "用户" as User
participant "内容中心页面" as UI
participant "前端 catalog 适配器" as Adapter
participant "内容路由" as Route
participant "ContentCatalog" as Catalog
participant "浏览器音频引擎" as Audio
User -> UI : 点击声音“试听”
UI -> Adapter : resolve(contentId)
Adapter -> Route : GET /api/v1/content/:assetId/playable?age_mode=...
Route -> Catalog : playable(idOrAssetId, ageMode)
Catalog -> Catalog : 检查内容存在、年龄、儿童限制
Catalog -> Catalog : 检查 enabled、audioPath、版权状态
alt 可播放
  Catalog --> Route : url, duration_sec, loop, playable=true
  Route --> Adapter : {data: 播放资源结果}
  Adapter --> UI : 可用资源
  UI -> Audio : preview(contentId)
  Audio --> UI : 开始试听或播放器错误
  UI --> User : 显示真实试听状态
else 年龄受限或资源不可用
  Catalog --> Route : 403 或 playable=false、url为空
  Route --> Adapter : 拒绝原因或不可用结果
  Adapter --> UI : 不启动播放器
  UI --> User : 提示不可试听
end
@enduml
